  "description": "A Coast Guard MH-60 Jayhawk helicopter crew medevacs an ailing 28-year-old crew-member of the 751-foot, Liberian-flagged bulk carrier TW Manila near Dutch Harbor, Alaska, May 5, 2014. Many Air Station Kodiak crew members, as well as crew members of the the Seattle-based Coast Guard Cutter Midgett worked together to successfully complete this long range medevac. U.S. Coast Guard video by Petty Officer 3rd Class Jonathan Klingenberg.",
